WEBVTT

01:36.500 --> 01:39.970
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.050 --> 01:41.960
[Episode 29]

01:42.920 --> 01:44.560
Dear visitors,

01:45.200 --> 01:46.350
welcome to

01:46.350 --> 01:49.039
our planetarium's Celestial Exhibition Hall.

01:49.920 --> 01:51.430
Here,

01:51.430 --> 01:53.680
we will take you on a journey through time and space

01:54.120 --> 01:56.200
to explore the mysteries of the universe

01:57.000 --> 02:00.560
and experience the vastness and beauty of the cosmos.

02:00.060 --> 02:03.720
[Wanghe]

02:02.910 --> 02:04.070
This Celestial Exhibition Hall

02:04.070 --> 02:06.640
is the core exhibition of our planetarium.

02:07.590 --> 02:10.590
This space features state-of-the-art technology for astronomical projections

02:10.590 --> 02:12.680
and virtual reality equipment.

02:13.840 --> 02:15.000
Where are you?

02:16.780 --> 02:18.280
Don't make me call the police.

02:20.290 --> 02:21.829
Where are you, really?

02:23.750 --> 02:25.000
You can see

02:25.000 --> 02:27.910
billions of stars and nebulae,

02:28.400 --> 02:31.750
and marvel at the majestic and mysterious beauty of the Milky Way.

02:29.000 --> 02:30.310
[Location]

02:33.190 --> 02:34.100
Additionally,

02:34.470 --> 02:36.960
you can personally experience

02:36.960 --> 02:39.710
various fascinating phenomena in the universe,

02:40.520 --> 02:42.700
such as supernova explosions,

02:42.800 --> 02:45.560
black holes, pulsars and more.

02:51.710 --> 02:52.280
Here.

03:01.630 --> 03:02.800
Why are you here?

03:03.890 --> 03:04.760
I'm tired.

03:05.010 --> 03:06.620
I came out

03:06.870 --> 03:07.800
to get some fresh air.

03:09.000 --> 03:10.360
Are you sick?

03:11.710 --> 03:13.140
Who told you that?

03:13.850 --> 03:15.060
Did you go to the hospital for a check-up?

03:16.070 --> 03:16.690
Yes.

03:17.070 --> 03:18.670
It's just anemia.

03:18.700 --> 03:19.800
It's nothing serious.

03:20.960 --> 03:21.920
Are you sure?

03:22.710 --> 03:23.710
Yes.

03:23.840 --> 03:25.520
Do you want to see my medical report?

03:29.000 --> 03:30.230
You really scared me.

03:38.900 --> 03:39.690
Look.

03:40.660 --> 03:42.500
UY Scuti.

03:43.320 --> 03:45.570
It's one of the largest known stars.

03:47.000 --> 03:48.550
Even the sun

03:48.970 --> 03:50.590
is just a speck of dust in front of it.

03:52.400 --> 03:53.860
Compared to it,

03:55.360 --> 03:57.079
we are all

03:58.520 --> 03:59.430
so tiny.

04:24.290 --> 04:30.520
[Ring Road] [Xidawang Road]

04:31.030 --> 04:32.260
Take a long leave.

04:32.659 --> 04:33.600
Go home and have some rest.

04:35.940 --> 04:37.040
I can't.

04:38.090 --> 04:39.240
Then quit.

04:42.070 --> 04:42.950
Quit?

04:42.970 --> 04:43.730
Will you provide for me?

04:45.080 --> 04:46.159
I will.

04:51.070 --> 04:51.630
No.

04:52.970 --> 04:53.780
Why?

04:54.810 --> 04:55.950
I'm capable myself.

04:56.700 --> 04:57.490
I don't need your help.

04:57.750 --> 04:59.120
If anything, I’d be the one supporting you.

05:02.260 --> 05:03.620
Just take some time off.

05:04.360 --> 05:05.720
Take some time to

05:05.750 --> 05:06.950
rest and recuperate.

05:08.000 --> 05:09.680
I'm in good health.

05:10.180 --> 05:11.840
You look so pale.

05:12.060 --> 05:13.050
How can you be fine?

05:13.890 --> 05:15.660
Your work is not that important.

05:15.690 --> 05:16.800
They won't starve to death

05:16.850 --> 05:17.840
without you.

05:18.730 --> 05:20.070
I'll try to hold on for a while.

05:20.310 --> 05:21.400
If I can't,

05:21.460 --> 05:22.350
I'll let you know.

05:22.550 --> 05:24.300
When that happens, it'll be too late.

05:24.360 --> 05:26.070
I’m looking out for you, so why don’t you listen to me?

05:26.800 --> 05:28.310
I'm so tired.

05:28.310 --> 05:29.310
I don't want to fight.

05:29.680 --> 05:30.970
Just drive.

05:38.670 --> 05:43.659
[Fenghua Express]

05:53.470 --> 05:55.060
Mr. Xie, Fenghua...

06:39.930 --> 06:40.590
Fenghua!

06:40.690 --> 06:41.770
You are asking for it!

06:44.190 --> 06:44.990
Come here!

06:47.080 --> 06:48.050
Xia Fenghua!

06:48.490 --> 06:49.590
You're so dead.

06:51.820 --> 06:52.980
Don’t come over!

06:57.800 --> 06:58.790
Xia Fenghua.

07:26.800 --> 07:27.600
You're awake.

07:32.380 --> 07:33.030
We've arrived?

07:37.510 --> 07:38.070
I'm leaving.

07:46.260 --> 07:50.130
[Fenghua Express]

07:46.980 --> 07:47.760
Wait.

07:56.080 --> 07:56.690
What?

07:57.030 --> 07:59.170
This is the prescription given by Grandpa Zhou.

07:59.640 --> 08:01.490
A foot bath before bedtime can boost your blood circulation.

08:05.570 --> 08:06.530
Don't just say okay.

08:06.880 --> 08:07.780
Make sure you do it.

08:08.080 --> 08:09.120
Use water of 40 degrees.

08:09.330 --> 08:10.460
Take a photo and send it to me.

08:12.450 --> 08:13.900
You want to see my feet?

08:14.250 --> 08:15.510
Are you a pervert?

08:16.650 --> 08:17.380
See you.

08:22.660 --> 08:23.500
Be careful.

08:27.000 --> 08:28.600
It's so cold. Go back.

09:13.070 --> 09:14.160
Go to bed early.

09:14.190 --> 09:15.310
Don't stay up late.

09:15.630 --> 09:16.560
[No, I won't]

09:21.590 --> 09:22.600
[No, I won't]

09:44.090 --> 09:44.880
Let me join you.

09:44.910 --> 09:45.440
No.

09:46.090 --> 09:46.980
How dare you!

09:47.010 --> 09:47.560
Come.

09:49.560 --> 09:51.560
♫You never hesitate to let me lean♫

09:52.210 --> 09:54.470
♫On your shoulder♫

09:57.010 --> 09:59.870
♫The cover page hides this story♫

09:58.790 --> 10:04.030
We'll never be apart!

10:00.430 --> 10:03.040
♫So many imagined dreams♫

10:04.430 --> 10:06.410
♫But I...♫

10:07.050 --> 10:12.220
♫I just want to hold your warm hand♫

10:10.670 --> 10:11.390
We've graduated.

10:11.390 --> 10:12.390
It's recording.

10:12.460 --> 10:13.030
Come, one...

10:12.740 --> 10:17.990
♫And gently press it against my chest♫

10:13.030 --> 10:13.510
Come on.

10:13.510 --> 10:18.440
We'll be together forever!

10:18.440 --> 10:19.870
Everything has been recorded.

10:19.780 --> 10:21.440
♫A faint light shines through the window♫

10:19.870 --> 10:21.820
I'll be where everyone else is.

10:21.890 --> 10:24.050
♫Glowing on a young face♫

10:22.320 --> 10:22.910
We've graduated!

10:24.270 --> 10:25.030
Wanghe.

10:24.650 --> 10:27.320
♫Nurturing dreams, yet leaving confusion behind♫

10:25.030 --> 10:25.790
Say something.

10:27.670 --> 10:29.150
I hope we can all be happy

10:28.100 --> 10:29.450
♫Time isn't a cure♫

10:29.150 --> 10:30.550
and be together forever.

10:29.870 --> 10:33.470
♫But the most bitter truth♫

10:30.550 --> 10:32.790
Let's never change.

10:32.790 --> 10:33.670
Never change.

10:34.150 --> 10:35.870
Let's adapt to change by remaining unchanged.

10:34.970 --> 10:38.250
♫I want to say goodnight to you♫

10:39.000 --> 10:42.280
♫So we won't get lost in the sea of dreams♫

10:40.080 --> 10:41.270
Let me have a look.

10:42.720 --> 10:44.120
Don't do it this way.

10:42.860 --> 10:45.830
♫You loved my fearless youth♫

10:46.670 --> 10:50.370
♫Only sober love remains pure and clean♫

10:51.020 --> 10:53.700
♫No matter what's good or bad♫

10:54.270 --> 10:57.950
♫I wish you find love in this lifetime♫

10:58.800 --> 11:00.110
♫Don't walk away with regret♫

11:00.850 --> 11:02.210
♫Reunions always come too late♫

11:02.790 --> 11:04.540
♫When the heavy rain falls♫

11:05.160 --> 11:08.880
♫I'll be there to hold an umbrella for you♫

11:42.750 --> 11:43.390
Hello.

11:43.630 --> 11:45.050
Hello.

11:45.200 --> 11:46.840
What are you doing?

11:47.320 --> 11:48.120
Having a foot bath.

11:49.910 --> 11:50.840
You caught a cold?

11:52.070 --> 11:52.870
No.

11:53.360 --> 11:54.910
Why do you sound so nasal?

11:55.630 --> 11:56.270
Do I?

12:02.630 --> 12:03.440
What about now?

12:04.550 --> 12:05.310
Did you cry?

12:05.870 --> 12:06.790
No.

12:08.440 --> 12:11.000
Don't be so paranoid all the time.

12:11.030 --> 12:12.440
I'm not a little girl anymore.

12:13.670 --> 12:15.120
You didn't look well when you came back last time.

12:15.200 --> 12:16.360
You looked pale.

12:16.590 --> 12:18.190
You had no energy at all.

12:19.970 --> 12:21.630
I was just tired.

12:23.230 --> 12:24.280
Don't worry.

12:24.910 --> 12:26.080
I won't stay up late anymore.

12:26.080 --> 12:28.130
You have to eat on time from now on.

12:28.630 --> 12:29.780
Eat well.

12:30.030 --> 12:31.200
Don't work so hard.

12:31.410 --> 12:33.110
If you're really worried,

12:34.040 --> 12:34.900
I'll come back.

12:35.510 --> 12:36.630
Don't bother.

12:37.080 --> 12:38.800
It's tiring to travel back and forth.

12:38.930 --> 12:41.030
You’d be better off using this time to get some proper rest.

12:41.120 --> 12:42.150
I mean it.

12:42.310 --> 12:43.850
I can provide parcel delivery services anywhere.

12:43.990 --> 12:45.070
I'll go back to Flower Street

12:45.100 --> 12:46.430
and open a new delivery station.

12:46.850 --> 12:48.040
Let's work together.

12:48.070 --> 12:48.910
We'll definitely make money.

12:48.960 --> 12:50.510
Are you serious?

12:53.720 --> 12:54.430
Yes.

12:57.200 --> 12:57.720
Mom.

12:59.370 --> 13:00.570
I miss home.

13:04.680 --> 13:05.290
It's okay.

13:05.330 --> 13:06.450
There's no rush.

13:06.630 --> 13:07.460
Let me...

13:07.490 --> 13:08.740
take care of matters

13:08.760 --> 13:09.550
in Beijing.

13:09.980 --> 13:10.830
Then I'll come home.

13:12.790 --> 13:13.630
Fenghua.

13:14.170 --> 13:15.480
This is a serious matter.

13:15.850 --> 13:17.180
Don't just joke about it.

13:17.720 --> 13:19.020
You have to think carefully.

13:20.200 --> 13:21.360
Don't worry.

13:21.530 --> 13:22.530
It's not that complicated.

13:23.590 --> 13:24.760
Soon,

13:25.150 --> 13:27.270
I'll deliver myself back to you

13:27.800 --> 13:28.490
as an urgent package.

13:32.600 --> 13:33.680
I'm hanging up.

13:38.950 --> 13:40.600
Fenghua just said

13:41.140 --> 13:42.810
she doesn't want to work in Beijing anymore.

13:42.910 --> 13:44.150
She wants to come back.

13:46.920 --> 13:49.090
Did something happen to her company?

13:49.480 --> 13:50.600
She didn't mention that.

13:51.080 --> 13:52.510
She just said she missed home.

13:59.410 --> 14:00.080
Hello, Mr. Qiu.

14:04.100 --> 14:04.920
Mr. Xie!

14:05.510 --> 14:07.420
Your buddy is going too far.

14:08.640 --> 14:09.390
Which buddy are you talking about?

14:09.390 --> 14:10.390
Shao Xingchi.

14:10.390 --> 14:11.840
As the Chief of Station 203,

14:11.860 --> 14:13.980
he actually allows the delivery riders under him

14:14.010 --> 14:15.980
to only take 30 orders a day.

14:16.120 --> 14:18.470
The rest of the orders are all dumped on Stations 202 and 204.

14:18.520 --> 14:19.160
What's the deal?

14:19.200 --> 14:21.460
Are the riders at Station 203 more precious than others?

14:22.010 --> 14:23.350
Do the lives of the riders in

14:23.390 --> 14:24.870
other areas no longer matter?

14:28.950 --> 14:29.710
Mr. Qiu,

14:30.890 --> 14:32.310
you're in charge of

14:32.410 --> 14:33.940
after-sales service.

14:34.440 --> 14:36.600
If Station 203 has been negligent in their work,

14:36.880 --> 14:38.030
you can take action with

14:38.030 --> 14:39.270
the company's policies.

14:39.680 --> 14:40.330
Alright,

14:41.110 --> 14:42.600
I will definitely take action as per

14:42.600 --> 14:43.720
the company's regulations.

14:43.740 --> 14:44.900
But Chief Shao

14:45.320 --> 14:47.790
is your best friend, Mr. Xie.

14:48.410 --> 14:49.620
If I'm going to deal with him,

14:49.670 --> 14:51.220
I should let you know first.

14:51.360 --> 14:52.860
I stand by my words.

14:53.940 --> 14:55.730
Any matters related to the company's business

14:55.880 --> 14:57.530
must be handled according to the rules.

14:57.960 --> 14:58.480
Alright.

14:59.360 --> 15:00.630
With your word,

15:00.780 --> 15:02.050
I'll do as planned.

15:02.670 --> 15:03.600
When the time comes,

15:04.050 --> 15:05.530
if I handled it too harshly,

15:05.890 --> 15:06.500
please...

15:06.530 --> 15:08.080
don't blame me for being inconsiderate.

15:13.240 --> 15:14.810
Next time when you come into my office,

15:15.270 --> 15:16.400
remember to knock.

15:23.280 --> 15:24.590
What are you looking at?

15:26.510 --> 15:27.710
Don't you have work to do?

15:32.620 --> 15:33.440
Come.

15:34.060 --> 15:35.320
I bought some snacks for everyone.

15:35.390 --> 15:36.030
Come, come,

15:36.030 --> 15:36.550
Thank you, boss.

15:36.630 --> 15:37.490
Here.

15:37.630 --> 15:38.990
Take whatever you like.

15:39.550 --> 15:40.630
Thank you, boss.

15:40.630 --> 15:41.270
It's nothing.

15:41.270 --> 15:42.320
Share it around.

15:42.400 --> 15:43.790
-Mr. Xie.
-Mr. Xie.

15:43.810 --> 15:45.120
Share these too.

15:45.210 --> 15:46.520
Don't drop them.

15:56.400 --> 15:57.240
What's wrong?

15:58.190 --> 15:59.430
You tell me what's wrong.

16:05.080 --> 16:07.150
Didn't we agree before

16:07.680 --> 16:09.150
that I'm in charge of Station 203?

16:09.320 --> 16:10.890
Everything will be done according to my rules.

16:10.910 --> 16:12.260
You won't change your rules

16:12.290 --> 16:13.120
even if they're wrong?

16:15.530 --> 16:17.670
I know our performance isn't ideal right now,

16:17.970 --> 16:19.290
but I have my own plans.

16:19.310 --> 16:21.110
I believe you have a backup plan,

16:21.510 --> 16:23.300
but do the delivery riders believe it?

16:23.550 --> 16:24.510
When everyone leaves,

16:24.510 --> 16:26.550
what good is your backup plan?

16:29.330 --> 16:30.960
If we follow the company's approach,

16:30.960 --> 16:32.040
everything will be in chaos.

16:32.060 --> 16:34.690
That's because you've spoiled them.

16:34.840 --> 16:37.190
Do you know how much effort we've put in

16:37.220 --> 16:39.800
to get the delivery riders used to to the current delivery pace?

16:39.820 --> 16:40.800
And you?

16:41.310 --> 16:42.910
People work to earn a living.

16:42.930 --> 16:44.240
We're not here for a vacation.

16:51.090 --> 16:52.610
If you think I'm not doing a good job,

16:53.380 --> 16:54.900
then replace me as the station chief.

16:55.600 --> 16:56.410
Cut to the chase.

17:01.710 --> 17:03.040
You know how much lower

17:04.190 --> 17:06.010
the income of Station 203's riders is compared to

17:06.069 --> 17:07.109
other stations, right?

17:08.240 --> 17:09.329
When we come out to work,

17:09.349 --> 17:10.420
when we take on a job,

17:10.660 --> 17:11.660
it's to make money.

17:12.150 --> 17:14.300
You can't be opposing against the mainstream.

17:15.980 --> 17:17.400
Do you know how much pressure

17:17.400 --> 17:19.069
a delivery rider faces in a day?

17:19.130 --> 17:21.260
Running on the streets day and night,

17:21.420 --> 17:22.980
only to be scolded by customers and merchants,

17:23.000 --> 17:24.560
and also by the pedestrians on the road.

17:24.589 --> 17:26.800
If there's even one order cancellation, bad review, or complaint,

17:26.880 --> 17:27.680
the company imposes a penalty.

17:27.680 --> 17:28.640
What can the delivery riders do?

17:28.680 --> 17:30.180
Do they deserve to be treated as less than human?

17:30.200 --> 17:31.860
Then what do you expect the company to do?

17:31.880 --> 17:33.670
If we're slower than others,

17:33.700 --> 17:36.070
if merchants and customers are dissatisfied with us,

17:36.090 --> 17:37.900
how can we compete with others?

17:37.920 --> 17:39.120
Competition, competition.

17:39.360 --> 17:41.330
Those two words are enough to give me a headache!

17:41.570 --> 17:42.660
The market is so big.

17:42.690 --> 17:44.080
Must we fight for first place?

17:44.110 --> 17:45.960
Do we really have to fight to death over this?

17:46.700 --> 17:48.390
We grew up by the canal.

17:48.690 --> 17:50.070
There are so many ships in the canal.

17:50.070 --> 17:50.880
Some ships sail fast,

17:50.880 --> 17:51.790
some sail slow.

17:51.790 --> 17:53.640
I've never seen a slow-moving ship get eliminated.

17:53.640 --> 17:55.910
That's because they have different shipping lanes.

17:57.130 --> 17:59.240
Now we're in the same lane.

18:00.240 --> 18:01.640
You may not have personally experienced

18:01.660 --> 18:02.730
the all-out business war in the past two years,

18:02.790 --> 18:03.920
but I have.

18:04.650 --> 18:06.440
Do you know how many companies

18:06.440 --> 18:08.430
went bankrupt in that competition?

18:08.820 --> 18:11.030
The reason Bee survived is due to

18:11.170 --> 18:14.230
the joint efforts of hundreds of thousands of employees and delivery riders.

18:14.570 --> 18:16.770
Once we fail in the competition,

18:17.010 --> 18:19.510
hundreds of thousands of people will instantly lose their jobs.

18:20.210 --> 18:21.730
I believe at that time,

18:21.980 --> 18:23.030
no one will care about

18:23.030 --> 18:25.100
your concern and sympathy for them.

18:25.220 --> 18:26.790
They will only complain about

18:26.860 --> 18:28.730
the management's incompetence!

18:32.740 --> 18:34.730
I believe everyone is aware of

18:32.980 --> 18:36.980
[To be self-aware, to self-improve, to self-enhance, to self-develop]

18:35.210 --> 18:37.220
the current situation of Station 203.

18:37.240 --> 18:38.380
I'm here today

18:38.410 --> 18:39.670
for nothing else

18:40.060 --> 18:41.280
but to change the rules.

18:41.460 --> 18:43.380
Starting from this month,

18:43.800 --> 18:44.730
Station 203

18:44.760 --> 18:46.920
must align and keep up

18:46.920 --> 18:47.920
with other areas.

18:47.940 --> 18:48.690
The goals are to

18:48.750 --> 18:51.000
ensure that the delay rate stays below 5%,

18:51.490 --> 18:53.290
and receive no negative reviews or complaints.

18:53.330 --> 18:54.440
If this is achieved,

18:54.520 --> 18:55.690
performance bonuses will be doubled.

18:57.340 --> 18:58.770
If this is not achieved,

18:59.780 --> 19:01.080
Station 203

19:01.400 --> 19:02.800
will be dissolved immediately

19:03.030 --> 19:05.230
and merged with Stations 202 and 204.

19:05.580 --> 19:06.100
Additionally,

19:09.390 --> 19:11.710
the delivery rider with the lowest number of orders

19:12.530 --> 19:13.560
will be fired immediately.

19:39.310 --> 19:40.550
This place is not bad.

19:43.120 --> 19:44.600
Boss, one bowl of noodles, please.

19:44.630 --> 19:45.670
To go.

19:45.690 --> 19:46.250
Okay.

19:48.170 --> 19:49.000
Bro?

19:50.830 --> 19:51.700
Here to pick up an order?

19:51.930 --> 19:53.440
No, I'm done for the day.

19:53.650 --> 19:55.780
I was thinking of getting a bowl of noodles to tide me over.

19:55.890 --> 19:57.050
Come have a drink.

19:57.680 --> 19:58.590
No thanks.

19:58.620 --> 20:01.010
I have to give a summary report to the higher-ups later.

20:01.180 --> 20:01.860
Come on.

20:02.390 --> 20:03.420
Have a drink.

20:03.700 --> 20:04.870
One drink won't hurt.

20:10.360 --> 20:11.780
Cheers.

20:12.510 --> 20:13.180
Cheers.

20:19.010 --> 20:20.810
Here, eat up.

20:22.360 --> 20:23.610
These have been grilled.

20:27.270 --> 20:27.830
Bro.

20:29.360 --> 20:31.040
You don't have to feel bad.

20:31.370 --> 20:33.700
Personally, we understand your good intentions.

20:34.070 --> 20:35.900
Everyone sings praises of you as a person.

20:35.930 --> 20:38.200
I'll get angry at anyone who says otherwise.

20:40.930 --> 20:42.220
Back then in the karaoke room,

20:42.540 --> 20:44.270
when I was being bullied by a room full of customers,

20:44.720 --> 20:45.550
you jumped in to help me with

20:45.550 --> 20:46.720
the drinking when you couldn't stand it,

20:46.740 --> 20:47.790
only to end up getting beaten.

20:47.790 --> 20:48.510
Of course.

20:48.960 --> 20:50.000
I'm your boss and you're my employee.

20:50.000 --> 20:51.720
How could I just watch you get bullied?

20:53.040 --> 20:53.600
Bro.

20:55.080 --> 20:56.920
All of us are aware of your kindness.

20:57.460 --> 20:58.850
But you're just...

20:59.160 --> 21:00.180
too nice.

21:00.460 --> 21:01.940
You're always thinking about what's best for us,

21:01.960 --> 21:03.240
but it's overly...

21:06.060 --> 21:06.930
It's a bit unrealistic...

21:07.630 --> 21:08.510
and disconnected from reality.

21:09.510 --> 21:10.670
You think I'm wrong too?

21:10.690 --> 21:11.740
You're not wrong.

21:11.830 --> 21:12.750
Mr. Xie was wrong.

21:15.210 --> 21:16.860
Then why don't you support me?

21:17.240 --> 21:18.030
We're poor.

21:19.790 --> 21:20.720
We're terrified of being poor.

21:23.200 --> 21:23.780
Bro.

21:24.350 --> 21:25.600
In our line of work,

21:25.850 --> 21:27.720
we work from dawn to dusk,

21:27.750 --> 21:29.070
and if we see a few hundred more

21:29.070 --> 21:30.440
in our account when we get home,

21:30.630 --> 21:31.670
that makes us happy.

21:32.010 --> 21:33.680
No matter how hard or tiring the work is,

21:34.130 --> 21:35.680
seeing the money in our wallet increase

21:35.700 --> 21:36.940
gives us peace of mind.

21:39.280 --> 21:39.830
Bro.

21:40.870 --> 21:42.090
Let me put it bluntly.

21:42.700 --> 21:44.000
Take me as an example.

21:44.250 --> 21:45.920
If anyone tries to stop me from making money,

21:46.310 --> 21:47.790
I'll get angry with them,

21:49.070 --> 21:50.440
even if they truly mean well for me.

21:55.560 --> 21:56.680
Aren't you afraid of working yourself to death?

22:00.870 --> 22:02.070
If I really can't take it anymore,

22:02.510 --> 22:03.510
I'll just lie down.

22:05.350 --> 22:06.410
It's still better than dying poor.

22:15.490 --> 22:18.000
A few years ago, before I came to Beijing,

22:18.070 --> 22:19.350
I was full of ambition.

22:19.600 --> 22:22.100
I thought since I was capable, smart and diligent.

22:22.120 --> 22:24.280
I thought I'd make something of myself in just a few years.

22:25.320 --> 22:26.720
But now, after all this time,

22:27.260 --> 22:28.700
I still have nothing.

22:29.150 --> 22:30.690
Every day, I still have to squeeze onto buses

22:30.990 --> 22:31.680
and subways,

22:32.270 --> 22:33.280
and sleep in a basement.

22:35.960 --> 22:37.760
Every time I see the lights

22:38.820 --> 22:39.890
in countless residential areas,

22:40.570 --> 22:41.780
lit up by countless lamps,

22:42.660 --> 22:44.720
I realised not a single one belongs to me.

22:46.090 --> 22:47.370
In Beijing,

22:48.010 --> 22:48.850
people like us

22:49.340 --> 22:51.060
are destined to be a passerby.

23:14.520 --> 23:16.980
If one day

23:18.020 --> 23:20.930
I must leave,

23:23.090 --> 23:24.570
I hope that

23:26.380 --> 23:30.180
people will bury me here.

24:04.260 --> 24:04.780
Come.

24:04.810 --> 24:06.100
Have some tea.

24:06.350 --> 24:07.020
Uncle,

24:07.100 --> 24:08.030
you don't have to be so polite.

24:08.180 --> 24:10.050
Haikuo and I were classmates.

24:10.200 --> 24:11.060
In terms of seniority,

24:11.090 --> 24:12.730
I'm a whole generation after you.

24:13.830 --> 24:15.480
Is Haikuo doing well in Beijing?

24:15.500 --> 24:16.220
Quite well.

24:16.250 --> 24:18.530
He's a programmer in the same company as Wanghe.

24:18.550 --> 24:19.390
Which company?

24:20.380 --> 24:21.050
It's called...

24:21.070 --> 24:21.750
Bee.

24:22.120 --> 24:23.120
The food delivery one.

24:24.050 --> 24:25.070
That's a big company

24:25.100 --> 24:26.320
worth tens of billions.

24:26.350 --> 24:28.070
It looks like Haikuo is thriving.

24:28.880 --> 24:30.590
No matter how much money there is, it has nothing to do with them.

24:30.610 --> 24:31.880
It's not theirs anyway.

24:32.360 --> 24:33.400
Can't compare to you,

24:33.430 --> 24:34.480
right?

24:34.590 --> 24:35.880
I'm just a small business owner.

24:35.900 --> 24:36.990
I haven't seen much of the world.

24:37.020 --> 24:39.410
I am just doing some small local business.

24:39.820 --> 24:40.450
But,

24:40.900 --> 24:41.960
I came today

24:42.120 --> 24:44.350
to discuss a great opportunity with you, Uncle.

24:45.440 --> 24:46.240
You see,

24:46.420 --> 24:47.550
with our Grand Canal

24:47.550 --> 24:50.030
becoming a World Heritage Site,

24:50.300 --> 24:52.150
Huaiyang cuisine is in high demand.

24:52.500 --> 24:53.250
A few days ago,

24:53.280 --> 24:54.930
the city leaders gave me an idea.

24:55.220 --> 24:57.020
They want to establish

24:57.110 --> 24:59.660
a Huaiyang cuisine heritage center in the city.

25:02.360 --> 25:03.950
That's a great idea.

25:04.250 --> 25:05.070
But I said,

25:05.100 --> 25:06.830
having the place without the right people won't work.

25:06.860 --> 25:09.350
We need to invite a master in Huaiyang cuisine.

25:09.370 --> 25:10.930
But throughout Honghuai,

25:11.250 --> 25:14.230
you're the only Huaiyang cuisine master we can count on.

25:14.890 --> 25:16.640
We want to invite you to come out of retirement

25:16.670 --> 25:18.260
and teach at the center.

25:18.280 --> 25:19.280
Only with your presence

25:19.310 --> 25:21.980
will this heritage center possess real value.

25:22.350 --> 25:23.550
We're thinking

25:23.570 --> 25:25.330
of moving this century-old By the Canal

25:25.360 --> 25:26.890
into the city

25:26.960 --> 25:29.170
and bring Huaiyang cuisine to greater heights

25:29.920 --> 25:32.910
by allowing more people to enjoy your culinary skills.

25:41.980 --> 25:46.010
[By the Canal]

25:44.050 --> 25:45.060
Master Zhou.

25:45.720 --> 25:46.530
Auntie.

25:46.550 --> 25:47.590
Long time no see.

25:49.260 --> 25:50.080
It's me,

25:50.210 --> 25:51.450
a classmate of Xingchi.

25:51.480 --> 25:52.030
Xing...

25:52.480 --> 25:53.520
Liang.

25:56.440 --> 25:57.820
Ah, Liang.

25:57.900 --> 26:00.170
I heard you're a big boss now.

26:00.220 --> 26:01.410
No, no.

26:01.640 --> 26:03.410
What brings you to Flower Street today?

26:03.680 --> 26:05.410
I came to invite Uncle Zhou,

26:05.440 --> 26:05.960
no,

26:06.420 --> 26:07.450
Master Zhou to come out of retirement

26:07.480 --> 26:09.270
to collaborate on a

26:09.270 --> 26:11.420
Huaiyang cuisine heritage center in the city.

26:13.300 --> 26:14.600
Alright, Uncle.

26:14.770 --> 26:15.810
I'll be going now.

26:15.840 --> 26:16.640
Please think it over.

26:16.660 --> 26:17.530
I'll wait for your response.

26:17.560 --> 26:18.880
Okay.

26:18.900 --> 26:19.420
Auntie,

26:19.480 --> 26:20.340
see you around.

26:20.480 --> 26:21.160
Alright.

26:21.200 --> 26:21.720
I'll be going now, Uncle.

26:21.720 --> 26:22.350
Okay.

26:22.370 --> 26:23.510
Take care.

26:23.690 --> 26:25.040
[By the Canal]

26:26.670 --> 26:28.160
A heritage center?

26:28.420 --> 26:29.480
Master Zhou,

26:29.650 --> 26:30.870
this is great news.

26:30.900 --> 26:32.200
Your business is growing.

26:35.000 --> 26:35.550
Yes.

26:43.580 --> 26:44.470
You're awake?

26:46.940 --> 26:47.750
Here, let me.

26:47.770 --> 26:48.380
I'll do it.

26:50.730 --> 26:52.040
I fell asleep.

26:53.730 --> 26:55.030
Dad, let me tell you something.

26:55.030 --> 26:56.200
You can't sleep out here anymore.

26:57.400 --> 26:58.640
It's raining outside.

26:58.660 --> 27:00.180
What if you catch a cold?

27:00.700 --> 27:02.720
Why aren't you in school today?

27:07.040 --> 27:09.220
The school unexpectedly gave us a day off.

27:10.220 --> 27:11.100
Okay.

27:11.850 --> 27:12.790
Have you eaten?

27:13.090 --> 27:13.640
Yes, I have.

27:16.440 --> 27:18.020
I'm a bit tired.

27:18.360 --> 27:19.610
I need a nap.

27:20.510 --> 27:21.220
Alright.

27:21.680 --> 27:23.380
If you get hungry,

27:23.660 --> 27:25.440
go eat at Auntie Ma's place.

27:26.020 --> 27:28.620
Bring a smoked fish with you while you're at it.

27:29.520 --> 27:30.220
Okay.

27:38.440 --> 27:40.480
If you don't want to study,

27:40.510 --> 27:41.980
then go learn to cook.

27:43.670 --> 27:45.570
As long as it makes you happy,

27:46.220 --> 27:47.330
I'll support you.

27:49.900 --> 27:51.690
Before the economic reform,

27:51.730 --> 27:53.770
chefs were looked down upon.

27:54.390 --> 27:56.140
It's not like that anymore.

27:56.960 --> 27:58.040
Cooking is

27:58.310 --> 27:59.380
a form of artistry too.

27:59.720 --> 28:00.280
That's right.

28:00.300 --> 28:03.420
A good chef is an artist.

28:03.850 --> 28:06.530
With exceptional skills,

28:06.550 --> 28:07.860
you can conquer the world.

28:10.410 --> 28:12.930
Master one skill, and it’ll take you far.

28:23.710 --> 28:25.030
You said you wanted to take a nap.

28:27.680 --> 28:28.540
You forgot?

28:41.150 --> 28:42.150
Granny Ma!

28:47.990 --> 28:48.710
Granny Ma!

28:52.980 --> 28:54.160
Granny Ma!

28:55.240 --> 28:56.430
It's me, Zhou.

28:59.030 --> 29:00.310
Granny Ma!

29:00.660 --> 29:02.660
-Mr. Zhou! Mr. Zhou!
-Mr. Zhou!

29:02.690 --> 29:04.130
What are you doing?

29:04.570 --> 29:05.850
I haven't seen

29:06.090 --> 29:07.290
Granny Ma all day.

29:07.680 --> 29:09.440
I'm worried something might have happened again.

29:12.720 --> 29:13.440
Mr. Zhou!

29:13.440 --> 29:16.170
Granny Ma went back home to visit her family.

29:16.850 --> 29:17.970
Yes, that's right.

29:18.000 --> 29:19.790
Her daughter-in-law had another baby.

29:19.810 --> 29:21.260
She went back to help with the postpartum care.

29:21.450 --> 29:21.970
Right.

29:22.000 --> 29:23.000
Yes, to help with the postpartum care.

29:23.040 --> 29:23.790
Yes.

29:24.000 --> 29:25.630
Isn't her son dead?

29:26.790 --> 29:29.630
How could his wife have a baby?

29:29.870 --> 29:31.670
The daughter-in-law remarried.

29:31.690 --> 29:33.980
She had a son with someone else.

29:37.130 --> 29:39.190
Granny Ma is just so kind-hearted.

29:39.950 --> 29:43.050
She’s taking care of someone who isn’t even her own grandchild.

29:43.110 --> 29:43.910
Yes.

29:46.680 --> 29:48.150
Now that Granny Ma is gone,

29:48.180 --> 29:49.700
what will happen to Siyi?

29:51.170 --> 29:53.300
We'll all look after Siyi.

29:53.640 --> 29:55.420
Don't worry, she won't go hungry.

29:55.440 --> 29:56.610
Yes, that's right.

29:56.780 --> 29:58.470
Yes, we're here for her.

29:58.980 --> 30:00.840
That's good, that's good.

30:01.550 --> 30:02.490
Tiancheng.

30:03.320 --> 30:04.350
When you sail again,

30:04.380 --> 30:06.780
bring a crucian carp for Granny Ma.

30:07.640 --> 30:08.360
That fish

30:08.380 --> 30:09.380
promotes lactation.

30:10.710 --> 30:12.290
I'll take care of this tomorrow.

30:12.350 --> 30:13.200
Alright.

30:13.750 --> 30:15.360
She didn't even say a word.

30:15.880 --> 30:18.160
She didn't even say a word.

30:19.400 --> 30:20.200
She didn't even say a word.

30:20.200 --> 30:21.590
Watch your step.

30:41.300 --> 30:42.370
Come on, have a drink.

30:42.430 --> 30:43.120
Sure.

30:44.640 --> 30:45.310
Come.

30:45.530 --> 30:46.480
Come on.

30:57.330 --> 30:58.600
So, what's the matter?

31:04.490 --> 31:05.500
Zhou,

31:07.090 --> 31:08.580
how many years has

31:08.960 --> 31:10.110
your restaurant been around?

31:11.760 --> 31:12.680
Over a hundred years.

31:14.830 --> 31:17.420
It's been famous since the day it opened.

31:18.060 --> 31:19.150
Back then,

31:19.410 --> 31:20.350
salt merchants from Yangzhou,

31:20.830 --> 31:22.490
Suzhou, and Hangzhou

31:22.520 --> 31:24.700
would come by boat specifically to dine here.

31:24.850 --> 31:26.520
That small dock simply

31:26.540 --> 31:27.580
couldn't fit everyone.

31:28.000 --> 31:30.240
People were packed so tightly they could barely stand.

31:31.090 --> 31:32.230
If it were today,

31:32.310 --> 31:34.380
it would be at least a two-star Michelin restaurant.

31:36.020 --> 31:38.420
Michelin doesn't understand Chinese cuisine.

31:38.730 --> 31:40.490
With my master's culinary skills,

31:40.520 --> 31:42.090
even eight stars wouldn't be enough.

31:42.250 --> 31:43.800
Right. There was another time,

31:43.830 --> 31:44.720
not long ago,

31:45.260 --> 31:47.060
an old gentleman from Taiwan came

31:48.020 --> 31:49.300
to dine at my restaurant.

31:49.740 --> 31:51.840
He specifically showed me an old photo.

31:53.180 --> 31:54.640
He said his father

31:54.880 --> 31:56.230
had dined here

31:56.600 --> 31:57.930
before the liberation.

31:58.850 --> 32:00.060
Later, he went to Taiwan

32:00.480 --> 32:02.640
and had been longing for it his whole life.

32:03.380 --> 32:04.550
As a result, this old gentleman,

32:04.750 --> 32:06.340
upon hearing that the restaurant was still open,

32:06.370 --> 32:08.060
came all the way from Taiwan

32:08.090 --> 32:09.360
to taste my traditional dishes.

32:09.900 --> 32:11.210
Let me tell you.

32:11.370 --> 32:14.530
Your cooking qualifies as intangible cultural heritage.

32:14.710 --> 32:15.650
You

32:15.670 --> 32:16.700
have the responsibility

32:16.810 --> 32:18.090
and the obligation

32:18.150 --> 32:19.540
to let more people

32:19.600 --> 32:21.070
taste the dishes

32:21.330 --> 32:22.590
from By the Canal.

32:22.640 --> 32:23.230
Isn't it?

32:23.350 --> 32:23.960
Yes, yes.

32:23.980 --> 32:25.500
I heard from Yuling that

32:25.530 --> 32:27.130
they're planning to open a shop in the city.

32:27.160 --> 32:28.030
That's good news.

32:28.050 --> 32:28.580
No.

32:29.370 --> 32:30.060
I can't go.

32:31.610 --> 32:33.160
I need to keep an eye on my shop.

32:33.180 --> 32:34.140
I can't get away.

32:34.200 --> 32:35.800
Is it really just because of that shop?

32:38.640 --> 32:39.840
Zhou,

32:40.350 --> 32:41.960
you can go without worrying.

32:42.710 --> 32:43.490
As for Mr. Zhou,

32:43.700 --> 32:45.160
we'll be here for him, right?

32:45.180 --> 32:45.510
Yes.

32:45.510 --> 32:46.830
Come, come.

32:56.180 --> 32:57.770
I'll just say what's on my mind.

32:58.890 --> 33:00.130
How many years have we been together?

33:01.700 --> 33:03.660
Don't you consider us family yet?

33:04.850 --> 33:05.890
No, it's not like that.

33:05.910 --> 33:07.660
What do you mean?

33:08.650 --> 33:10.730
Yan has already told us everything.

33:11.690 --> 33:12.680
Let me put it this way.

33:12.680 --> 33:13.920
Previously, Yan and Haihong,

33:13.920 --> 33:15.310
along with Yuling, went to the hospital

33:15.330 --> 33:17.050
to see how others care for patients.

33:17.690 --> 33:19.370
They discovered that nursing

33:19.390 --> 33:20.500
is not that simple.

33:20.530 --> 33:22.900
It requires a lot of professional knowledge.

33:23.480 --> 33:25.560
They brought back a small booklet

33:25.950 --> 33:27.110
and studied it every day.

33:27.630 --> 33:28.120
Look.

33:28.140 --> 33:28.970
It's all densely written.

33:29.000 --> 33:30.720
There are a lot of notes too.

33:31.060 --> 33:32.340
Don't worry.

33:32.510 --> 33:34.260
Leave Mr. Zhou to us.

33:34.280 --> 33:36.390
We won't let him suffer even the slightest discomfort.

33:36.960 --> 33:38.810
You won't have to worry about a thing.

33:40.030 --> 33:41.340
We're all from the same courtyard.

33:41.480 --> 33:42.480
Tell me,

33:42.830 --> 33:44.940
how is it any different from being family?

33:45.440 --> 33:47.050
When an elder in our own family falls ill,

33:47.070 --> 33:48.870
how could we not care?

33:49.740 --> 33:52.090
You can put your mind at ease.

33:54.240 --> 33:55.160
Look.

33:59.090 --> 34:01.590
[Morning] [Noon] [Afternoon] [Evening] [Night]

33:59.330 --> 34:00.020
They've

34:00.520 --> 34:02.170
even laid out

34:02.200 --> 34:03.290
a duty roster.

34:03.310 --> 34:04.770
In our courtyard,

34:04.890 --> 34:06.230
there are four households,

34:06.260 --> 34:07.180
and seven adults.

34:07.500 --> 34:09.670
Including of Chen Rui and his father,

34:09.670 --> 34:10.900
that means we still have

34:09.739 --> 34:11.659
[Morning] [Noon] [Afternoon] [Evening] [Night]

34:10.960 --> 34:14.000
capacity to take turns caring for him.

34:14.239 --> 34:15.150
This way,

34:15.150 --> 34:16.230
firstly, it's not tiring,

34:16.230 --> 34:17.480
so we keep going at it.

34:17.480 --> 34:19.510
Secondly, it feels natural.

34:19.510 --> 34:22.050
Mr. Zhou wouldn't suspect a thing.

34:22.130 --> 34:22.900
Also,

34:23.280 --> 34:25.600
we've created a WeChat group.

34:25.630 --> 34:27.070
You should join in too.

34:27.350 --> 34:28.139
From now on,

34:28.300 --> 34:30.530
anything related to Mr. Zhou,

34:30.650 --> 34:32.360
we'll communicate in the group chat.

34:32.380 --> 34:34.100
Yes, it's so convenient now.

34:34.130 --> 34:34.940
If anything happens,

34:34.960 --> 34:35.960
just send a message in the group.

34:35.989 --> 34:37.320
We’ll tackle it as a group.

34:37.340 --> 34:37.860
That's right.

34:37.889 --> 34:39.179
Let me tell you,

34:39.210 --> 34:41.980
this is the outcome of their research.

34:42.840 --> 34:44.360
Yes, I know.

34:44.360 --> 34:46.190
They've been researching for a long time.

34:46.230 --> 34:46.960
We'll...

34:46.960 --> 34:48.230
j-just go with this plan.

34:48.230 --> 34:50.480
Don't worry, nothing will go wrong.

34:55.730 --> 34:56.840
I...

34:57.100 --> 34:58.480
It's not that

34:59.090 --> 35:00.570
I was deliberately hiding it from all of you.

35:00.880 --> 35:02.650
I really just didn't want to

35:03.140 --> 35:04.260
trouble you all.

35:07.930 --> 35:09.610
But come to think of it,

35:09.800 --> 35:11.510
your wife's got quite a loose tongue.

35:11.510 --> 35:13.420
If it weren't for my wife...

35:15.620 --> 35:16.600
Well,

35:17.740 --> 35:18.740
let's not talk about it anymore.

35:20.860 --> 35:21.740
Thanks, guys.

35:21.770 --> 35:22.370
Here.

35:24.350 --> 35:25.230
Thank you.

35:26.000 --> 35:27.240
Talk about being polite.

35:32.820 --> 35:33.920
Have some food.

35:39.510 --> 35:40.320
Uncle!

35:40.810 --> 35:41.360
Uncle.

35:41.490 --> 35:42.370
You even came out to greet me.

35:42.390 --> 35:43.150
You're here.

35:43.230 --> 35:44.150
Have you thought it over?

35:44.930 --> 35:46.100
San Liangzi.

35:46.920 --> 35:47.890
I was planning

35:47.920 --> 35:49.060
to call you.

35:49.110 --> 35:49.880
But I thought it would

35:49.900 --> 35:51.320
be better to tell you in person.

35:51.350 --> 35:52.180
Please, go ahead.

35:52.290 --> 35:54.310
I've asked the legal department prepare the contract.

35:54.330 --> 35:55.850
Don't worry, the share distribution is well-arranged.

35:55.920 --> 35:56.590
Wait a minute.

35:56.630 --> 35:58.110
Don't be so anxious.

35:58.140 --> 35:59.990
You need to hear me out first.

36:03.390 --> 36:04.400
Regarding your proposal,

36:04.440 --> 36:05.510
I've been thinking about it,

36:06.300 --> 36:08.130
and I think we should forget about it.

36:09.860 --> 36:10.870
Why?

36:14.690 --> 36:16.230
Look at this shop.

36:16.600 --> 36:17.720
It's a century-old business.

36:19.210 --> 36:20.490
Let me put it this way.

36:20.620 --> 36:22.010
Since the Qing Dynasty,

36:22.040 --> 36:23.280
many guests have

36:23.310 --> 36:24.790
traveled by boat for days and nights

36:24.810 --> 36:26.290
just to come here for a meal.

36:27.130 --> 36:28.460
Do you know why?

36:30.060 --> 36:30.900
Please tell me.

36:33.410 --> 36:34.720
Look at this tree,

36:37.290 --> 36:38.520
this Grand Canal,

36:39.510 --> 36:40.630
and this sign.

36:42.290 --> 36:43.850
The guests who come here

36:44.780 --> 36:46.120
get to feel the breeze from the canal,

36:47.010 --> 36:48.860
and hear the hawkers on Flower Street.

36:48.890 --> 36:50.440
They may be enjoying the food,

36:50.810 --> 36:53.210
but it's the essence of Flower Street they’re truly experiencing.

36:55.830 --> 36:56.830
So, you see,

36:56.860 --> 36:59.300
the local environment shapes the local cuisine.

36:59.320 --> 37:01.510
If we really leave the canal,

37:01.920 --> 37:02.730
I think

37:03.200 --> 37:04.080
the canal's cuisine

37:04.550 --> 37:05.670
would lose its flavor.

37:06.930 --> 37:08.740
So you mean, I...

37:08.770 --> 37:10.030
What I mean is,

37:10.110 --> 37:12.400
the idea of a heritage center is very good.

37:12.780 --> 37:14.740
If you were to set up the center

37:14.910 --> 37:16.000
here on Flower Street,

37:16.030 --> 37:16.840
I would definitely join

37:16.860 --> 37:17.970
without any hesitation.

37:18.490 --> 37:21.010
But compared to the city, the customer flow on Flower Street

37:21.040 --> 37:22.250
is still a bit lacking, isn't it?

37:22.270 --> 37:22.940
Yes.

37:23.290 --> 37:24.440
I know.

37:24.720 --> 37:25.640
So,

37:26.490 --> 37:28.670
you should go ahead with your plans.

37:29.770 --> 37:31.690
I'll have to decline your kind offer.

37:32.770 --> 37:34.210
With your excellent skills,

37:34.240 --> 37:35.880
do you really have to stay on Flower Street?

37:36.480 --> 37:37.690
I'll stay on Flower Street.

37:40.400 --> 37:42.160
I won't take up any more of your time.

37:42.220 --> 37:43.300
Get back to work.

37:46.020 --> 37:47.290
Sorry to bother you, Uncle.

37:47.320 --> 37:48.390
I'm sorry about that.

37:50.560 --> 37:51.850
Mr. Sun is here?

37:52.080 --> 37:52.810
Auntie.

37:55.030 --> 37:55.960
I'll be going then, Uncle.

37:56.000 --> 37:56.480
Alright.

37:56.510 --> 37:57.420
Goodbye, Auntie.

37:58.580 --> 38:00.250
Xingchi, come visit us when you're back home.

38:01.800 --> 38:03.120
I'm sorry about that.

38:07.010 --> 38:07.830
What happened?

38:08.270 --> 38:10.000
The deal didn't go through?

38:10.430 --> 38:11.470
I turned him down.

38:11.500 --> 38:12.230
Turned him down?

38:17.620 --> 38:19.500
♫When the moon hangs in the sky♫

38:19.400 --> 38:21.960
In November 1947,

38:20.090 --> 38:21.930
♫And it's cooling in the yard♫

38:21.960 --> 38:24.320
the People's Liberation Army passed through Shuipu Town.

38:22.770 --> 38:26.010
♫Who is still by your side?♫

38:24.400 --> 38:26.440
Fortunately, there was a

38:26.440 --> 38:29.920
local boy named Zhou Yipu.

38:27.270 --> 38:30.830
♫As time passes♫

38:30.640 --> 38:31.440
Is this right?

38:31.650 --> 38:35.090
♫Is a lifetime really that long?♫

38:32.820 --> 38:34.340
He was familiar with the terrain,

38:34.370 --> 38:35.850
so he helped relay messages

38:35.870 --> 38:37.830
and successfully obtained intelligence about Yancheng.

38:37.860 --> 38:39.520
It's all here, isn't it?

38:38.950 --> 38:40.700
♫When youthful company fades♫

38:39.540 --> 38:41.140
Yes, it is.

38:41.170 --> 38:41.960
That's me.

38:41.380 --> 38:43.380
♫Leaving only small talk and pleasantries♫

38:41.960 --> 38:42.590
That's me.

38:42.630 --> 38:43.670
That's me.

38:43.710 --> 38:44.920
I remember back then,

38:43.970 --> 38:47.380
♫Spring feels short, while autumn lingers♫

38:44.960 --> 38:46.960
there was a very tall soldier

38:46.960 --> 38:47.870
who asked me,

38:47.900 --> 38:49.540
"What's your name?",

38:48.630 --> 38:52.130
♫A gentle breeze carries dreams away♫

38:50.310 --> 38:52.450
"Are you familiar with this path?"

38:52.710 --> 38:55.020
I was just a playful child back then,

38:53.070 --> 38:57.100
♫Dreamland and dreams♫

38:55.040 --> 38:56.180
always running into the mountains.

38:56.200 --> 38:57.380
I would be

38:57.410 --> 38:59.120
running up those mountain paths,

38:59.140 --> 39:01.180
catching crickets and grasshoppers.

39:01.970 --> 39:04.710
♫Life is long♫

39:06.200 --> 39:09.390
♫No need to dwell♫

39:10.820 --> 39:13.660
♫Like moonlight♫

39:15.210 --> 39:18.480
♫Don't forget♫

39:15.590 --> 39:16.700
You get it, right?

39:20.700 --> 39:23.530
♫Life is long♫

39:23.010 --> 39:25.320
Why is he leaving without paying?

39:24.860 --> 39:27.870
♫No need to dwell♫

39:25.860 --> 39:26.840
Well,

39:27.320 --> 39:28.570
let me handle this.

39:29.450 --> 39:32.460
♫Like moonlight♫

39:30.970 --> 39:31.780
How much is it?

39:31.950 --> 39:32.720
30,000 yuan.

39:33.770 --> 39:34.830
It's made of Chinese rosewood.

39:33.920 --> 39:38.450
♫The old times♫

39:39.990 --> 39:40.840
How about...

39:42.170 --> 39:43.360
we ask Mr. Zhou for the money.

39:43.360 --> 39:43.760
Okay.

39:43.760 --> 39:44.840
Alright.

39:44.870 --> 39:46.070
Grandpa.

39:46.190 --> 39:47.890
I am working overtime with my colleagues.

39:49.040 --> 39:50.090
There's no one there.

39:50.110 --> 39:51.720
Look, this is our company.

39:51.750 --> 39:52.390
There's no one here.

39:52.480 --> 39:53.280
How is it?

39:53.410 --> 39:54.450
No one's here.

39:54.480 --> 39:55.610
Right, they've gone home.

39:57.550 --> 39:58.280
Look!

39:58.700 --> 40:00.550
♫When the moon hangs in the sky♫

39:58.920 --> 39:59.760
Here's two of them.

39:59.760 --> 40:00.360
Grandpa.

40:00.360 --> 40:01.030
Grandpa.

40:01.190 --> 40:03.010
♫And it's cooling in the yard♫

40:02.390 --> 40:04.230
Long time no see, Grandpa.

40:03.740 --> 40:07.210
♫Who is still by your side?♫

40:05.770 --> 40:06.770
How have you been lately?

40:06.800 --> 40:07.700
Goodbye.

40:08.150 --> 40:08.800
Good.

40:08.440 --> 40:11.960
♫As time passes♫

40:08.800 --> 40:10.280
How's your appetite been lately?

40:10.280 --> 40:11.550
Take care of yourself, Grandpa.

40:12.440 --> 40:14.070
Grandpa, I miss you.

40:12.650 --> 40:16.340
♫Is a lifetime really that long?♫

40:14.070 --> 40:15.840
I'll come visit you when I get back.

40:19.820 --> 40:21.740
♫When youthful company fades♫

40:22.330 --> 40:24.110
♫Leaving only small talk and pleasantries♫

40:24.280 --> 40:25.550
We're almost at our house.

40:25.030 --> 40:28.230
♫Spring feels short, while autumn lingers♫

40:29.280 --> 40:30.030
Slow down, be careful.

40:29.690 --> 40:33.130
♫A gentle breeze carries dreams away♫

40:30.030 --> 40:30.930
Slowly, slowly.

40:31.030 --> 40:31.630
Don't fall.

40:31.630 --> 40:32.450
Are you alright, Grandpa?

40:34.150 --> 40:37.900
♫Dreamland and dreams♫

40:34.820 --> 40:35.630
Fenghua!

40:35.630 --> 40:36.320
Wanghe!

40:37.110 --> 40:38.110
Eat less snacks.

40:38.110 --> 40:39.390
It's time for dinner.

40:39.420 --> 40:40.980
Grandpa will tell you a story.

40:42.850 --> 40:45.740
♫Life is long♫

40:43.560 --> 40:44.610
Mr. Zhou,

40:44.990 --> 40:46.660
tell me a story first.

40:46.890 --> 40:48.130
Come on, let's take a break.

40:46.920 --> 40:50.000
♫No need to dwell♫

40:52.010 --> 40:55.210
♫Like moonlight♫

40:56.600 --> 40:57.650
It's your turn.

40:56.710 --> 40:59.830
♫Don't forget♫

41:01.510 --> 41:04.340
♫Life is long♫

41:03.400 --> 41:05.060
Mr. Zhou, where's my rook?

41:05.090 --> 41:06.140
I just moved.

41:06.160 --> 41:07.030
It's your turn.

41:06.200 --> 41:09.260
♫No need to dwell♫

41:08.840 --> 41:09.510
Alright.

41:09.550 --> 41:10.370
Okay.

41:10.790 --> 41:13.950
♫Like moonlight♫

41:10.980 --> 41:12.090
It's okay.

41:13.430 --> 41:15.790
I'll jump, jump, and jump.

41:15.460 --> 41:19.740
♫The old times♫

41:15.810 --> 41:17.430
Jump and jump.

41:18.690 --> 41:20.520
You're playing Chinese checkers?

41:20.550 --> 41:21.790
The horse moves in an L-shape.

41:20.750 --> 41:23.830
♫Life is long♫

41:23.150 --> 41:23.840
Okay.

41:25.080 --> 41:28.330
♫No need to dwell♫

41:27.840 --> 41:28.830
This soup,

41:28.850 --> 41:30.730
it's really authentic.

41:29.670 --> 41:32.710
♫Like moonlight♫

41:32.460 --> 41:33.270
Really authentic.

41:34.040 --> 41:34.640
Look,

41:34.670 --> 41:36.020
this is my father.

41:34.760 --> 41:37.870
♫Like moonlight♫

41:36.050 --> 41:38.380
He ate here back in 1929.

41:38.440 --> 41:39.770
Look at this plaque.

41:39.270 --> 41:42.440
♫Life is long♫

41:40.680 --> 41:42.550
He ate right here.

41:44.260 --> 41:47.260
♫No need to dwell♫

41:48.760 --> 41:51.880
♫Like moonlight♫

41:53.580 --> 41:57.620
♫The old times♫

41:54.740 --> 41:56.030
Have you made up your mind

41:56.060 --> 41:57.580
during this time?

41:57.810 --> 41:59.560
Do I only have these two options?

41:59.580 --> 42:01.580
Theoretically, yes.

42:01.600 --> 42:03.280
If you opt for surgery,

42:04.230 --> 42:05.710
we can manage its growth

42:05.730 --> 42:07.930
to some extent.

42:08.910 --> 42:09.690
But...

42:09.710 --> 42:11.420
there are associated risks with any surgery,

42:11.710 --> 42:12.670
especially craniotomy.

42:13.100 --> 42:14.410
During the operation,

42:14.440 --> 42:15.960
there are many uncontrollable factors.

42:16.290 --> 42:17.130
Besides,

42:18.390 --> 42:19.940
there's a possibility of relapse after the operation.

42:22.250 --> 42:23.670
What about conservative treatment?

42:23.920 --> 42:25.170
This tumor will grow

42:25.190 --> 42:26.420
faster and faster.

42:27.230 --> 42:28.980
It will continue to oppress your nerves.

42:29.960 --> 42:31.080
I've made up my mind.

42:31.830 --> 42:33.340
I'll continue with conservative treatment.

42:36.240 --> 42:37.240
Are you sure?

42:38.900 --> 42:40.410
You're still young.

42:40.530 --> 42:41.880
You can give it a try.

42:45.710 --> 42:46.590
No.

42:47.560 --> 42:49.120
Instead of risking it,

42:49.550 --> 42:51.160
I want to hold onto something

42:51.190 --> 42:52.810
that is more tangible.

42:54.030 --> 42:55.020
Okay, then.

42:56.200 --> 42:57.410
Think about it some more.

42:58.280 --> 42:59.160
If

42:59.230 --> 43:00.190
you change your mind,

43:00.210 --> 43:01.470
you can come to me anytime.

43:03.110 --> 43:03.840
Thank you.
